5103.42.text:
Section 5103.42 |
[Former R.C. 5103.422, amended and renumbered by H.B. 33, 135th General Assembly, effective 10/3/2023] Regional training staff responsibilities.
Effective: 2023-10-03
A regional training staff's responsibilities shall include all of the following:
